			"arabicnumber": 3657,
			"text": "Ibn Salamah As-Sulami narrated that the Prophet (ﷺ) said:\"I enjoin each one to honor his mother,I enjoin each one to honor his mother,I enjoin each one to honor his mother(three times), I enjoin each one to honor his guardian who is taking care of him, even if he is causing him some annoyance",
